---
#
# Test specific clang-tidy configuration. Inherits the checks of the repository root
# and relaxes the ones that only make sense for production code.
#
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,
  -misc-use-internal-linkage,
  -readability-function-size,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
  -cert-err58-cpp

#
# Catch2 test case bodies are not headers, so nothing is diagnosed twice here.
# A test REQUIREs an optional to hold a value before it reads it, the check does not know that REQUIRE ends the
# test. A static of a test that throws on its initialization fails the test run, which is what a test wants.
#
